2026-09-02T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2171) 'description: When naming what the workspace makes (the pipeline) and what leaves it (the deliverable), use "atelier-workshop" and "shuttle". Never "atelier" alone. Never rename the shuttle after nx-shuttle's separate use of the same word.
 # tags: rfd:front-matter
 Text:RFD2171  1 LINE
 Text:Written

