2026-09-02T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2171) 'The atelier-workshop / shuttle vocabulary
 # tags: rfd:details-title
 Text:RFD2171  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2171) 'The pipeline is `atelier-workshop`, the deliverable that leaves it is `shuttle`. One word for each, used verbatim in RFD titles, changelogs, and public prose.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2171  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2171) 'Never use `atelier` alone in shipping prose (loanword, pretentious without the gloss). `Workshop` alone is permitted where context already fixes it (the 2021 `character-workshop` decision doc stays).
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2171  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2171) '
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2171  1 LINE
 Text:Written

