2026-09-02T00:00:28Z (RFD66606-2171) '  Retained without change; `nx-shuttle` already uses it for the same weft-across-warp metaphor.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2171  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:00:29Z (RFD66606-2171) '  The two uses do not conflict: one shuttles a character out, the other shuttles a graph across.
